58	 *
59	 * The tag goes on only when the root itself is running (#449). A stop tag is a request
60	 * to a job polling THIS node's thread; posted on a parent with no run of its own it
61	 * requests nothing, and — with the merged-pull-request defect — it was posted on every
62	 * close of a parent that had ever merged a pull request, saying `stop=requested` about
