51	 * the repository's hourly API budget one run spends. At 30 seconds a full-length run
52	 * costs about 110 requests against a 1000/hour limit, and a person waits at most half
53	 * a minute plus however long the agent's current tool call takes -- which is usually
54	 * the larger half.
55	 */
56	const DEFAULT_INTERVAL_SECONDS = 30;
